		(property "Sourcing_Note" "Contacts BOTTOM, matching J6/J7/J10 so every FFC on the product presents its contacts to the board and all four connectors take a cable with the stiffener on the same face. Corrects a part-number error: Value/MPN/DigiKey_PN previously read FH12A-24S-0.5SH(55) (HFK124CT-ND), the contacts-TOP variant, while this symbol, its HRS_FH12-24S-0.5SH_55_ land and its Description were always the contacts-BOTTOM FH12-24S-0.5SH(55). Same series, same 2.00mm height above board, same land pattern - no layout change. Active, ~15,300 in stock, $2.41/1 cut tape."
			(at 80.01 175.26 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
